# Tailwind tooling — keep the production deploy build-free. Excluding package.json
# stops Vercel from treating this as a Node project (no build step runs); we build
# css/tw.css locally and ship it as a static asset. The /design-system page loads
# css/styles.css + css/tw.css (both shipped). src/tailwind.css is the source only.
node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json
src/
